    <briefdescription>
<para>C++ source file with implementations for the µTest++ stopwatch. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This source file contains the implementation of the <computeroutput>stopwatch</computeroutput> class of the µTest++ framework. It provides the member functions that read the system clock (monotonic on POSIX) at the start and at the end of the measured interval, and that compute the elapsed time between the two readings, and <computeroutput>read_clock()</computeroutput>, which isolates the platform-specific access to the system clock.</para>
<para>All definitions reside within the <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacemicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1detail" kindref="compound">micro_os_plus::micro_test_plus::detail</ref></computeroutput> namespace.</para>
<para>This file must be included when building the µTest++ library. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
